# Menace (CR 702.110): one Memnite cannot block Reno and Rude (the refusal), so it connects. With no other creature or artifact on
# Bot1's side there is nothing to sacrifice and nothing is asked: the exiled Lightning Bolt cannot be played (the refusal).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Reno and Rude
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x8
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reno and Rude.Cast
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Reno and Rude > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Memnite > Reno and Rude)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
